eBeacon
Copyright 2025 eBeacon Contributors

This project was built from scratch and contains no copied source code from
other projects. However, its feature set and architectural design were
informed by the following open-source projects:

  eRPC (https://github.com/erpc/erpc)
  Copyright 2024 Vendora Pte. Ltd.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

    No source code from eRPC was used. eBeacon's network-based routing,
    secret authentication flow, upstream forcing headers
    (X-ERPC-Use-Upstream), and response header naming (X-ERPC-Upstream)
    were designed for compatibility with eRPC's conventions. Concepts such
    as score-based routing, request multiplexing, rate limit auto-tuning,
    consensus verification, and reorg-aware caching were inspired by
    eRPC's feature set.

  Dugtrio (https://github.com/ethpandaops/dugtrio)
  By the ethPandaOps team (no license declared in repository at time of writing)

    No source code from Dugtrio was used. eBeacon's client-type path
    routing (e.g. /lighthouse/eth/v1/...), session rebalancing, and
    canonical fork detection were inspired by Dugtrio's approach to
    beacon API load balancing.
